# WindowLens — agent rules

## Deploy is human-owned

The agent edits **source only**. Do not build, sign, install, or launch WindowLens.

Forbidden unless the user explicitly asks in that message:
- `swift build`, `xcodebuild`, `codesign`
- Creating/updating `.app` bundles or copying to `/Applications`
- Running `./dev-relaunch.sh`, `open …WindowLens.app`, `killall WindowLens`

## Canonical run path (developer)

```bash
./dev-relaunch.sh
```

That builds with `xcodebuild`, syncs to `/Applications/WindowLens.app`, and launches.
Use `./dev-relaunch.sh --skip-build` to relaunch without compiling.

Do not reintroduce `build-app.sh` unless explicitly requested. One script is enough: `dev-relaunch.sh`.
